WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Claude has made a change

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.900
C-c c D D opens the review of what the session changed

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:12.000
T asks Claude for a tour: it comments on lines and scrolls to them

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.700
t goes to the next stop

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:21.300
c on Claude's comment replies to it

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:24.900
C-c C-c sends the reply, and the review stays open

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:29.300
Claude answers under your comment and changes the file

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:33.300
The review follows the files: the new diff, with the answer
